  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/adm1000.html",
  "prefLabel": "Adm 1005.02 Method of Repayment of the Cost of Appointed Counsel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 1005.02 Method of Repayment of the Cost of Appointed Counsel.\n\n(a) A defendant shall, within 5 days after a repayment order is issued:\n\n(1) Make the initial payment to the office of cost containment or the department of corrections, as specified in Adm 1005.01; and\n\n(2) Contact the office of cost containment to confirm his or her mailing address.\n\n(b) After making the initial payment the defendant shall make installment payments monthly, or as otherwise ordered by the court, subject to Adm 1005.03.\n\n(c) A defendant shall contact the office of cost containment whenever requested to do so by letter or phone call from the office of cost containment.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 1000) #8697, eff 8-3-06; ss by #10728, eff 11-25-14; ss by #13050, eff 7-1-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/adm1000.html"
